---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---

<Base title="Running RECN on your Mac — RECN" description="Keep RECN in the background, bring it back from anywhere, and record with a shortcut.">
  <Header />
  <main class="simple-page shell" id="main-content">
    <header class="simple-page__header">
      <p class="label">GUIDE</p>
      <h1>Running RECN on your Mac</h1>
      <p>RECN can stay out of the way until you need it. Windows works the same way, with the tray instead of the menu bar and <kbd>Ctrl</kbd><kbd>Alt</kbd> in place of <kbd>⌃</kbd><kbd>⌥</kbd> (New… is <kbd>Ctrl</kbd><kbd>Alt</kbd><kbd>Shift</kbd><kbd>N</kbd>, since <kbd>Ctrl</kbd><kbd>Alt</kbd><kbd>N</kbd> is New project inside RECN).</p>
    </header>

    <article class="prose guide">
      <h2 id="background">It keeps running in the background</h2>
      <p>Turn on <strong>Settings › Background › Keep RECN running in the background</strong>. A tape-reel icon appears in the menu bar. It turns red while RECN is recording.</p>
      <p><kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>Q</kbd> now sends RECN to the background instead of quitting. To really quit, choose <strong>Quit RECN</strong> from the menu-bar icon or the Dock icon’s menu.</p>
      <figure class="guide-menu" aria-label="The menu-bar icon’s menu">
        <div class="guide-menu__bar">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 28 16" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="7" cy="8" r="5.5" /><circle cx="21" cy="8" r="5.5" /><circle cx="7" cy="8" r="1.5" /><circle cx="21" cy="8" r="1.5" /></svg>
        </div>
        <ul>
          <li><span>Open RECN</span><small>⌃⌥Space</small></li>
          <li><span>New…</span><small>⌃⌥N</small></li>
          <li><span>New Recording</span></li>
          <li class="is-split"><span>Settings…</span></li>
          <li><span>Quit RECN</span></li>
        </ul>
      </figure>

      <h2 id="getting-back">Getting it back</h2>
      <p>Click the Dock icon, choose <strong>Open RECN</strong> from the menu-bar icon, or press <kbd>⌃</kbd><kbd>⌥</kbd><kbd>Space</kbd> from any app. The Library window always comes back.</p>

      <h2 id="shortcuts">Shortcuts from any app</h2>
      <dl class="guide-keys">
        <div><dt><kbd>⌃</kbd><kbd>⌥</kbd><kbd>Space</kbd></dt><dd>Show RECN.</dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>⌃</kbd><kbd>⌥</kbd><kbd>N</kbd></dt><dd>New note, drawing, session, recording, project or import.</dd></div>
        <div><dt><kbd>⌃</kbd><kbd>⌥</kbd><kbd>R</kbd></dt><dd>Record straight to the Library, no window. Press again to stop.</dd></div>
      </dl>
      <p>Change any of them in Settings: click the shortcut and press a new one.</p>

      <h2 id="new">New things start named and filed</h2>
      <p>From <kbd>⌃</kbd><kbd>⌥</kbd><kbd>N</kbd> or <kbd>⌘</kbd><kbd>N</kbd>, pick what to make, give it a name and choose its project, or leave it Loose. Then start. Nothing lands in the Library as “Untitled”.</p>

      <p>Something not behaving like this? <a href={`${base}support/`}>Tell us</a>.</p>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Base>

<style>
  .guide { max-width: 70ch; }
  kbd {
    display: inline-block;
    min-width: 1.7em;
    margin-right: 3px;
    padding: 0.05em 0.4em;
    border: 1px solid var(--divider);
    border-bottom-width: 2px;
    background: var(--surface);
    color: var(--ink);
    font: 600 0.8em/1.5 var(--mono);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .guide-menu { width: min(100%, 300px); border: 1px solid var(--divider); background: var(--surface); }
  .guide-menu__bar { display: flex; justify-content: flex-end; padding: 6px 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider); background: var(--card); }
  .guide-menu__bar svg { width: 28px; height: 16px; fill: none; stroke: var(--ink); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .guide-menu ul { margin: 0; padding: 6px 0; list-style: none; }
  .guide-menu li { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin: 0; padding: 3px 14px; color: var(--ink); font-size: 0.85rem; gap: 12px; }
  .guide-menu li.is-split { margin-top: 6px; padding-top: 9px; border-top: 1px solid var(--divider); }
  .guide-menu small { color: var(--secondary); font: 500 0.72rem/1.6 var(--mono); }

  .guide-keys { margin: 1.2em 0 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--divider); }
  .guide-keys div { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 150px 1fr; padding: 10px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--divider); gap: 16px; }
  .guide-keys dt { white-space: nowrap; }
  .guide-keys dd { margin: 0; }

  @media (max-width: 480px) {
    .guide-keys div { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 4px; }
  }
</style>
